EXT. GOTHAM CITY - DARK ALLEY - NIGHT

The narrow alley is cloaked in shadows, the perfect hideout for Gotham's petty criminals. ANDREA moves stealthily, his senses heightened as he hears the low murmur of voices ahead.

LEADER OF CRIMINALS
(whispering)
Keep an eye out. The Bat's been sniffing around.

Andrea steps forward, his presence commanding as the criminals turn to face him.

ANDREA
(calmly)
You picked the wrong night to be out here.

The group hesitates for a moment, then lunges forward, weapons drawn. Andrea moves with precision and agility, effortlessly disarming the first attacker with a swift kick. The second criminal swings wildly, but Andrea ducks, delivering a powerful counter-punch.

The alley echoes with the sounds of the scuffle, but Andrea remains focused, taking down each opponent with calculated efficiency. The last criminal drops to the ground, defeated.

ANDREA
(breathing steadily)
Tell your boss—Gotham's under protection.

He surveys the scene, satisfied with the outcome. As he leaves the alley, Andrea feels a renewed sense of purpose, knowing he's made the streets a little safer tonight.
===GAME END===

