ANDREA
(to himself)
This place never gets any less unsettling.

He approaches a junction where a guard nods in acknowledgment, granting him access to a secured section. Andrea scans the area, his eyes settling on a small access terminal.

ANDREA
(focused)
Let's see what secrets you hold.

