INT. BANKS HOUSEHOLD - HALLWAY - DAY

Oliver, filled with newfound excitement, ventures down the hallway of the Banks household. Each door he passes seems to hold a secret, and he can't wait to discover what lies behind them.

He stops at a door slightly ajar, peeking inside to see a room filled with old toys. As he steps in, the toys begin to animate, dancing around him in a playful parade.

OLIVER
(laughing)
This is amazing! The toys are alive!

Mary Poppins appears at the doorway, her presence calming yet encouraging.

MARY POPPINS
(cheerfully)
Magic is everywhere if you know where to look, Oliver. Remember, it's your imagination that brings it to life.

Oliver nods, his confidence growing. He continues through the room, each step bringing more magic to the surface. The atmosphere in the house feels lighter, a testament to the growing harmony.

